OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon data centre near M25 gets
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon has been given the go-ahead to
OL,7,Fbuild a huge data centre beside the
OL,8,FM25, despite concerns about its
OL,9,Fenvironmental impact.
OL,11,FThe development will replace 17
OL,12,Findustrial and warehouse units on the
OL,13,FRidgeway Distribution Centre in Iver,
OL,14,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,16,FThe Ivers Parish Council said the
OL,17,Fbuilding would have a negative impact
OL,18,Fon air quality and traffic, but
OL,19,FBuckinghamshire Council approved the
OL,20,Fplans on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
