OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon data centre near M25 gets
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers concluded that the need for
OL,7,Fdata centres, the employment benefits
OL,8,Fand an expected reduction in vehicle
OL,9,Fmovements outweighed other
OL,10,Fconsiderations.
